1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,900
Dad, isn't Hope the place where you go drinking?

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:06,400
You're still up? This movie is fifteen and over.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:12,967
Son, this Hope means hope! The pub kind is hops, the stuff in beer! That's why it's a hof!

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Not hops. German Hof: the royal court. It came from a court beer hall.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:18,567
…Huh?

6
00:00:18,867 --> 00:00:23,933
Wrong answer number one. I'm Modapman.

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:35,000
Case summary. The movie kept the kid up. Next day, the question. Location: an observatory.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,267
Are aliens real?

9
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:41,767
Of course. Those UFOs on the news are alien spaceships.

10
00:00:41,767 --> 00:00:46,967
UFO just means a flying object nobody's identified yet. It doesn't mean aliens.

11
00:00:46,967 --> 00:00:52,500
Wha? Wha? Wha? Wha… AAAH!

12
00:00:52,533 --> 00:01:00,300
Wrong answer, two. Yesterday's winner, knocked out in one day.

13
00:01:00,333 --> 00:01:04,233
I heard an alien spaceship flew into our solar system last year! Gotta wave hello!

14
00:01:04,233 --> 00:01:07,467
It was a comet. A lump of ice from another star.

15
00:01:07,467 --> 00:01:09,300
A lump… of ice.

16
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:15,567
Wrong answer, three. Dad waved hello to an ice cube.

17
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:17,667
Okay. Just three rounds.

18
00:01:17,667 --> 00:01:19,900
The observatory does rounds too…?

19
00:01:19,933 --> 00:01:25,567
Round one. A UFO is something we haven't figured out yet. That's all.

20
00:01:25,567 --> 00:01:31,100
Most turn out to be balloons, drones, planes, or a really bright Venus.

21
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:36,300
The US Defense Department went through eighty years of reports. No evidence of aliens.

22
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:39,167
Don't know? UFO. Figure it out? Just a balloon!

23
00:01:39,167 --> 00:01:43,267
Then that shiny thing I saw from the balcony last night…

24
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:44,300
Venus.

25
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:50,067
Round two. Alien life means any life beyond Earth. Even tiny microbes.

26
00:01:50,067 --> 00:01:53,000
Not little green guys with octopus heads?

27
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,800
Scientists start by looking for tiny traces.

28
00:01:55,800 --> 00:02:01,067
Last year, a leopard-spotted rock turned up on Mars. Ancient microbes may have made it.

29
00:02:01,067 --> 00:02:03,200
Microbes lived on Mars?!

30
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:07,233
We don't know yet. It's only a maybe. It still has to be checked.

31
00:02:07,233 --> 00:02:12,333
Round three. Aliens are the ones among them that talk and build machines.

32
00:02:12,333 --> 00:02:16,567
So we listen for signals from space with giant radio telescopes.

33
00:02:16,567 --> 00:02:20,567
We've been listening for over sixty years. Not one confirmed signal yet.

34
00:02:20,567 --> 00:02:22,967
Then the aliens could just come visit.

35
00:02:22,967 --> 00:02:28,467
Even the nearest star is too far. Today's spacecraft would need over 70,000 years.

36
00:02:28,467 --> 00:02:32,333
Seventy thousand years… bit long for a vacation.

37
00:02:32,367 --> 00:02:39,867
In one line: a UFO is just unknown. Alien life is any life beyond Earth.

38
00:02:39,867 --> 00:02:50,200
Aliens are the ones we could talk to. And none of it is confirmed. Yet.

39
00:02:50,367 --> 00:02:51,967
So there are no aliens?

40
00:02:51,967 --> 00:02:55,067
Not no. We just don't know yet.

41
00:02:55,067 --> 00:03:02,133
There are so many stars out there. So tonight, too, someone's listening.

42
00:03:02,133 --> 00:03:04,733
Is that why the movie's called Hope?

43
00:03:04,733 --> 00:03:05,733
…Maybe so.

44
00:03:05,733 --> 00:03:06,867
I want to listen too.

45
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:12,167
My kid stood there for a long time, ear turned to the sky.

46
00:03:12,333 --> 00:03:15,833
Look! A red light, blinking! It's an alien signal!

47
00:03:15,833 --> 00:03:17,000
That's a plane.

48
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:19,600
…Then let's celebrate. One round at the hops place.

49
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,767
Dad, Hof means royal court!

50
00:03:21,767 --> 00:03:25,433
Wrong answer, four. Modapman strikes again.
